<title>SRI LANKA: Development up 3.9 pct on renewed buying.</title>
<headline>Development up 3.9 pct on renewed buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Development Finance Corporation of Ceylon rose 3.85 percent, or 10 rupees to 270 on renewed buying interest in early Tuesday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Buying is creeping back after the share fell to 260 rupees following a rise to over 290 rupees in the recent rally,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Colombo stocks are settling down after a correction which began on April 23, following a rally which saw the all share index rise over 15 percent.</p>
<p>Development Finance is one fo two blue chip development finance firms listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
